  "note": "Triennial election of the nineteen electoral divisions of Kilkeel rural district, one member each, polled in County Down on 25 May 1933. Four divisions were contested (Ballymartin, Kilkeel North, Maghera, Rostrevor); in the other fifteen the sole nominee was returned unopposed. Majority 9."
